{
  "name": "review-request-engine",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "review-request",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d1a2c3d4-0001-4a01-9001-jobdonewebhook",
      "name": "Job Complete Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -220,
        320
      ],
      "webhookId": "d1a2c3d4-0001-4a01-9001-jobdonewebhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.name ?? $json.query?.name ?? $json.name ?? 'there').toString().trim() || 'there' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "name": "phone",
              "value": "={{ (() => { const raw = ($json.body?.phone ?? $json.query?.phone ?? $json.phone ?? '').toString().trim(); if (!raw) return ''; if (raw.startsWith('+')) return '+' + raw.slice(1).replace(/\\D/g, ''); let d = raw.replace(/\\D/g, ''); if (d.startsWith('00')) return '+' + d.slice(2); const defaultCountryCode = '1'; return '+' + defaultCountryCode + d; })() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ ($json.body?.email ?? $json.query?.email ?? $json.email ?? '').toString().trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e1000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
              "name": "reviewLink",
              "value": "https://g.page/r/REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_REVIEW_LINK/review",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d1a2c3d4-0002-4a02-9002-capturecustomr",
      "name": "Capture Customer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        20,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 2,
        "unit": "hours"
      },
      "id": "d1a2c3d4-0003-4a03-9003-waittwohours00",
      "name": "Wait 2 Hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        260,
        320
      ],
      "webhookId": "d1a2c3d4-0003-4a03-9003-waittwohours00"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "send",
        "from": "+15555555555",
        "to": "={{ $('Capture Customer').item.json.phone }}",
        "toWhatsapp": false,
        "message": "=Hi {{ $('Capture Customer').item.json.name }}, thanks for choosing [Business]! If we did a good job, a quick review means the world to us: {{ $('Capture Customer').item.json.reviewLink }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d1a2c3d4-0004-4a04-9004-reviewrequestsms",
      "name": "Send Review Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twilio",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        500,
        320
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "credentials": {
        "twilioApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_TWILIO_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Twilio account (replace me)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Review Requests",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Phone": "={{ $('Capture Customer').item.json.phone }}",
            "Name": "={{ $('Capture Customer').item.json.name }}",
            "Email": "={{ $('Capture Customer').item.json.email }}",
            "Requested At": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "Status": "Requested",
            "Reviewed?": ""
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "Phone"
          ],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "Phone",
              "displayName": "Phone",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Name",
              "displayName": "Name",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Email",
              "displayName": "Email",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Requested At",
              "displayName": "Requested At",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Status",
              "displayName": "Status",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Reviewed?",
              "displayName": "Reviewed?",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            }
          ],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": true
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d1a2c3d4-0005-4a05-9005-logreviewreqst",
      "name": "Log Review Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        740,
        320
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account (replace me)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⭐ review-request-engine — START HERE\n\nA couple hours after a job/order is marked done, this texts the customer a one-tap Google review link — when they're happiest. More reviews = higher local ranking + more trust.\n\n```\nJob Complete Webhook → Capture Customer → Wait 2h → Send Review Request → Log Review Request\n```\n\n### Buyer setup checklist\n- [ ] **Webhook** → activate, copy *Production URL*, fire it when a job is marked complete (POST `name`, `phone`, `email`)\n- [ ] **Capture Customer** → set your **reviewLink** field (THE key step — see the green sticky)\n- [ ] **Wait 2h** → change the delay if you like\n- [ ] **Send Review Request** → Twilio creds + `from` number + edit message / `[Business]`\n- [ ] **Log Review Request** → pick Sheet + tab (`Review Requests`)\n- [ ] Activate. (Wait nodes only resume on an **active** workflow.)\n\nAll credentials are placeholders — nothing sends until you connect your own.",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d1a2c3d4-0006-4a06-9006-stickyoverview",
      "name": "Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -660,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔑 Your Google review link (set once)\n\nEdit the **reviewLink** field in *Capture Customer* — this is the single variable the buyer sets once.\n\n**Get your short link:**\n1. Search your business on Google → open your Business Profile.\n2. Click **\"Ask for reviews\"** (or *Get more reviews*).\n3. Copy the short link — looks like `https://g.page/r/XXXXXXXX/review`.\n\nNo Business Profile yet? Create/claim it at business.google.com first. Paste the exact link so the SMS opens the review box in one tap.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "d1a2c3d4-0007-4a07-9007-stickyrevlink0",
      "name": "Note - Review Link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -180,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Wait duration\n\nDefault is **2 hours** after the job is marked done — long enough that the experience is over, fresh enough that they still feel it.\n\nChange `amount` / `unit` here (e.g. 1 day for slower-burn services).\n\n⚠️ Wait nodes pause the execution and resume later — they only work when the workflow is **Active**.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "d1a2c3d4-0008-4a08-9008-stickywaitnote",
      "name": "Note - Wait",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Track & don't ask twice\n\n*Log Review Request* uses **Append or Update** matched on **Phone**, so the same customer isn't logged twice.\n\nColumns (header row 1):\n`Phone | Name | Email | Requested At | Status | Reviewed?`\n\nMark **Reviewed?** = yes when a review lands, to keep your list clean. Want to skip already-reviewed customers automatically? Add an *IF* before the SMS that checks this sheet (notes in BUILD_NOTES).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d1a2c3d4-0009-4a09-9009-stickytracknot",
      "name": "Note - Tracking",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        -120
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
